      buy_market: 'Capture is by playing a card that sums to 15 with table cards; no buying from market.',
      buy_stock: 'New cards come only via dealer redeal when hands empty; no draw-from-stock.',
      fold: 'No folding; every player plays each hand to completion.',
      check: 'No betting; no check action.',
      call: 'No betting round; no call.',
